{"repositoryId":466528251,"availability":"available","full":"tossnet/Blazor-Calendar","name":"Blazor-Calendar","description":"Yearly, monthly and weekly calendar Blazor Component . For use with .NET 10, 9 and 8 or higher Blazor applications","category":"Productivity","language":"C#","stars":142,"forks":31,"created":"2022-03-05T17:54:48Z","updated":"2026-10-14T07:59:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tossnet.github.io/Blazor-Calendar/","topics":["blazor","blazor-application","blazor-client","blazor-component","blazor-example","blazor-server","blazor-ui-components","blazor-wasm","blazor-webassembly","calendar","nuget","planning","schedule","wasm"],"demo":"https://tossnet.github.io/Blazor-Calendar","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:51.221Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:51.221Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:51.221Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T22:45:51.221Z","stars":142,"forks":31}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["WeekView can optionally select a time range on the empty grid or hour scale. Enable the interaction and handle RangeSelected in the host application:","Press the primary mouse button on a 15-minute slot, drag within the same day, and release on the last included slot. Dragging upward normalizes the range. For example, selecting 09:00 through the 10:45 slot returns [09:00, 11:00). A single slot returns 15 minutes. The final 23:45 slot ends at midnight on the following day. The selected range is highlighted while dragging.","Escape (with the grid focused), leaving the grid, pointer cancellation or crossing into another day cancels the selection. Releasing outside a selectable slot also cancels it. Existing task click/drag callbacks are retained; selecting a range never inserts, modifies or persists tasks. The host decides what the callback means. Desktop mouse interaction is tested; touch-specific capture/gesture handling is not included."],"features":[]